1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,797
Speaking, task four. Situation number 4. The examiner describes a situation. Agree with her, choose one option and say why.

2
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:19,259
Some friends are coming over on Saturday. We want to cook dinner together. What shall we cook? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

3
00:00:27,967 --> 00:00:29,280
We could cook fish.

4
00:00:29,567 --> 00:00:31,236
I don't like fish, I don't like the taste.

5
00:00:31,533 --> 00:00:32,861
Then let's make pizza.

6
00:00:33,167 --> 00:00:35,075
We had pizza last week.

7
00:00:35,367 --> 00:00:36,843
Then let's cook goulash.

8
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:38,675
And why do you want to cook that?

9
00:00:38,967 --> 00:00:42,105
Because everyone likes goulash and we can cook it in advance.

10
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:45,374
OK, goulash is a good idea. Let's cook goulash.

11
00:00:45,667 --> 00:00:55,038
Practise situation 4 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
